 "text": "Here's the cheat sheet I follow 📝\n\n(2 minute chart for trading shorter term trends. Higher timeframes for a wider outlook) \n\nBullish EMA trend 📈\n\n13 EMA on top 🟡\n48 EMA in middle 🟣\n200 EMA on bottom 🔴\n\nRemember,\n\nAbove 200 EMA = Bullish\nAbove 200 + 48 EMA = More Bullish https://t.co/iYu0P5CvBq",
